              "en": "P(white) = 5/10 = 1/2."
            },
            "why": {
              "en": "Favourable = 5."
            }
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "en": "P(not red) = 1 - 3/10 = 7/10."
            },
            "why": {
              "en": "Complement rule."
